 r←ShowLastVersionInIndex(space folder args);name
⍝ Desc: Returns the last version of an APL object or a file in the index
⍝ Parse: 1 -project=
⍝ Project: 1
 name←args._1
 :If ∧/~'/\:'∊name                 ⍝ A filename must not be qualified, of course
 :AndIf ~(⊃name)∊'#⎕'
     name←(⍕space),'.',name
 :EndIf
 r←folder ##.ShowLastVersionInIndex name
⍝Done
